                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">6</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Summons 1x Herald of Khorne / Tzeentch / Nurgle / Slaanesh with 30 pts or wargear (see Codex: Chaos Daemons). If successfully invoked, one friendly model with 6” of the psyker takes a wound with no saves of any kind allowed.</characteristic>
