      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a unit with a squig hound fails a Morale check it suffers D6 Strength 3 AP`-` hits and must then re-roll the failed Morale check. If the re-roll is failed, it cannot be re-rolled again, and the squig hound will not inflict any further hits.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
