    <profile name="Fixin&apos; Klaws" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="2dab-7811-fac7-5a9d">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A Meka-dread equipped with fixin’ klaws counts as having a set of Mek’s tools (and may attempt to fix itself, when not affected by either a Crew Stunned or Crew Shaken damage result, as well as other vehicles).</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Mega-Charga" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="383b-ee06-e925-1e81">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This item may be used only once per game. Its use can be declared at the start of any Movement phase, after which the controlling player should roll a D6. On the roll of a 1, the model is immobilised (no saves of any kind may be taken against this damage). On any other result the model gains the Fleet special rule for the duration of the turn in which the mega charga was activated.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
